Cell["\<\
Seen this way, you seem to watch a parabolic mirror focusing, reversing the \
ray paths.
So, this tells you how to shape the parabolic mirror, so that the BCO is in \
the focus.... APPROXIMATELY.....
Is the r/2 on-axis the optimal emission point is SOME SENSE?\
\>", "Text",
